{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/2a338cf34b8b744f92d3a8d595047126.poster.avif?t=1757651805\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/2a338cf34b8b744f92d3a8d595047126.webm?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your dream sushi truck in Sushi On Wheels! Prep ingredients, customize your truck, and serve handmade sushi to hungry locals. Upgrade your gear, discover new recipes, and build your reputation in this cozy management game set in a charming Japanese town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/3ad4ffa08b682aeaf876813902da2e55.poster.avif?t=1757651805\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/3ad4ffa08b682aeaf876813902da2e55.webm?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/3ad4ffa08b682aeaf876813902da2e55.mp4?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the finest ingredients, ready your tools, and decide which mouthwatering creations will tempt customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/88edbd2bd5279248c11c4b9a19f6cb5b.poster.avif?t=1757651805\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/88edbd2bd5279248c11c4b9a19f6cb5b.webm?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/88edbd2bd5279248c11c4b9a19f6cb5b.mp4?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow winding roads, visit vibrant markets, and find hidden gems across the Izu Peninsula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/ServeGif.gif?t=1757651805\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcraft sushi with care, charm your customers, and watch your reputation grow one happy smile at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/02becee8af6e8a526581a63736ed27c9.poster.avif?t=1757651805\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/02becee8af6e8a526581a63736ed27c9.webm?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/02becee8af6e8a526581a63736ed27c9.mp4?t=1757651805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new cooking tools, expand your space, and dress both you and your truck in a style that\u2019s uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/49007b2abf160b780acfdcd979bc4510.poster.avif?t=1757651805\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c